OL,3,AMicrosoft says AI rival Anthropic could
OL,4,Ahave 'disastrous impact' on humanity
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft's head of AI has warned
OL,7,FAnthropic's approach to training its AI
OL,8,Fmodel Claude could have a "disastrous
OL,9,Fimpact on the wellbeing of humanity".
OL,11,FMustafa Suleyman said his rival risked
OL,12,Fcreating something "impossible" to
OL,13,Fcontrol by treating it like a human -
OL,14,Fincluding by telling it it "may be
OL,15,Fconscious" and was "deserving of
OL,16,Findependent agency".
OL,18,F"We must not sleepwalk our way into a
OL,19,Fdecision we later come to bitterly
OL,20,Fregret," he wrote.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/20
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
