SC,0012
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1789574061
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHow being music's Mr Nice Guy
OL,4,Acontributed to biggest crisis of Ed
OL,5,ASheeran's career
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe has carefully cultivated a
OL,8,Fnon-threatening, everyone welcome
OL,9,Fpublic image. In 2014, he donated his
OL,10,Fentire wardrobe to charity shops. The
OL,11,Fsame year, he adopted a one-month-old
OL,12,Fkitten, saving it from euthanasia, and
OL,13,Fnamed it Graham. Today, he runs a
OL,14,Fcharity providing music lessons to
OL,15,Funder-18s in his home county of
OL,16,FSuffolk.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/20
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
